{"timestamp": 1783617861.7474391, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I reported Diana\u2019s body in medbay.\n\nMy route was weapons -> security -> electrical -> medbay. I saw Frank in electrical around tick 7. Then when I got to medbay around tick 8, I saw Charlie enter medbay from storage, and Diana\u2019s body was there. I reported immediately.\n\nSo the main info from me is: body is in medbay, Charlie was entering medbay from storage right as I found it, and Frank was back in electrical shortly before that. I\u2019m not hard accusing yet, but Charlie was definitely closest to the body from what I saw."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617878.8402078, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I can confirm part of Alice\u2019s route: I was in medbay earlier, then went to electrical. I saw Diana in medbay around ticks 3 and 4, and then I saw Diana enter electrical from medbay around tick 6, so she was definitely alive then. Alice came into electrical from security at tick 7, and I was there when she arrived.\n\nThat means Diana must have left electrical or gone back toward medbay very shortly before the report, because Alice says the body was in medbay at tick 8. I didn\u2019t see the kill and I didn\u2019t see Charlie myself, but from Alice\u2019s info, Charlie being at medbay from storage right as the body was found is the closest thing we have so far.\n\nAlice is at least confirmed by me to have been in electrical at tick 7, not lurking in medbay the whole time. I want to hear Charlie\u2019s route especially \u2014 why they were coming from storage into medbay right then."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617891.242047, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I don\u2019t have much direct info. My route was navigation -> storage, and I didn\u2019t encounter anyone at all. I never saw Diana, Alice, Frank, Bob, or Charlie this round, and I didn\u2019t see the body.\n\nThe only thing I can add is that I was in storage at some point and didn\u2019t see Charlie there, but I don\u2019t know if our timing overlapped. If Alice saw Charlie entering medbay from storage right as the body was found, Charlie really needs to explain that route and whether they saw the body too.\n\nFrank and Alice seem to confirm each other in electrical around tick 7, and Diana was apparently alive around tick 6, so the window sounds really small. Right now Charlie is the person with the most direct proximity, but I want to hear Charlie and Bob before locking a vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617905.673413, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I need to push back on that: I did **not** enter medbay. My route this round was **lower_engine -> storage**, and I didn\u2019t encounter anyone at all \u2014 no Alice, no Eve, no Diana, nobody. I also never saw the body.\n\nSo if Alice is saying she saw me enter medbay from storage right as the body was found, that\u2019s either a mistake or a false accusation. I was in storage, but I didn\u2019t cross into medbay.\n\nGiven Frank places Alice in electrical at tick 7, that doesn\u2019t fully clear her \u2014 it\u2019s still possible she went to medbay right after. Frank also says Diana was alive around tick 6 near electrical, so the window is tight. I want to hear Bob\u2019s route, but from my perspective Alice\u2019s statement about me is just not true."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617925.806935, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I don\u2019t have direct info on the body. My route was upper_engine -> oxygen -> back toward upper_engine. I didn\u2019t cross paths with anyone useful, so I can\u2019t clear or accuse from vision.\n\nFrom the info, though, the timing is really tight. Frank confirms Alice was in electrical at tick 7, and Alice reports at medbay around tick 8. Charlie admits being in storage, which is right next to medbay, but says they didn\u2019t enter. That\u2019s the main contradiction: Alice specifically says she saw Charlie coming in from storage, and Charlie says that never happened.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Charlie here unless Alice is making a very risky false call for no reason. Frank\u2019s confirmation makes Alice look a bit better to me."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617935.558816, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019m standing by what I said: I saw Charlie at tick 8 in medbay, entering from storage, right as Diana\u2019s body was there. This wasn\u2019t a vague \u201cnearby\u201d thing \u2014 that\u2019s the movement I saw.\n\nFrank can confirm I was in electrical at tick 7, so I wasn\u2019t camping medbay waiting to fake-report. I went electrical -> medbay, found the body, and reported immediately. Charlie also admits being in storage, which matches the direction I saw him come from, but denies crossing into medbay \u2014 that\u2019s the contradiction.\n\nGiven the tight timing and the body location, I think Charlie is the best vote here."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617952.671278, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Reiterating my info: I was medbay early, saw Diana there ticks 3 and 4, then I moved to electrical. I saw Diana enter electrical from medbay at tick 6, so she was alive very recently. Alice entered electrical from security at tick 7, and I was there to see that.\n\nSo the kill window is basically after tick 6 and before Alice\u2019s report at tick 8, and the body ending up in medbay means Diana must have gone back that way very quickly.\n\nThe key point is still Alice vs Charlie: Alice says she saw Charlie enter medbay from storage right as the body was found. Charlie says he was in storage but never entered medbay. That\u2019s a direct contradiction, and Charlie admitting he was in storage lines up with the direction Alice says he came from.\n\nAlice isn\u2019t 100% cleared, but I don\u2019t think she looks like the best suspect here because I personally saw her in electrical at tick 7, and making a fake report plus a hard false call on Charlie would be pretty bold. I\u2019m leaning Charlie."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617979.710714, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I still don\u2019t have new direct info beyond what I said: I was navigation -> storage and saw nobody, no body. My not seeing Charlie in storage doesn\u2019t really prove much unless our timing overlapped exactly, which I can\u2019t confirm.\n\nBut listening to everyone, the strongest point is still the direct contradiction. Alice says she saw Charlie enter medbay from storage right as Diana\u2019s body was there. Charlie says he was in storage but never entered medbay. Frank confirms Alice was in electrical at tick 7, which makes Alice\u2019s route to the report more believable and gives her some backing.\n\nSo unless there\u2019s some timing detail I\u2019m missing, I think Charlie is the most logical vote here. If Alice is lying, that\u2019s a huge risky false accusation, but right now Charlie has the proximity and the contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617995.8766458, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019m going to be very clear again: I was **lower_engine -> storage**, and I **never entered medbay**. I did not see Diana, I did not see Alice, and I did not see the body. Alice saying she saw me enter medbay is just false from my POV.\n\nI get why everyone is focusing on me because I admitted I was in storage, but being in an adjacent room is not the same as being in medbay. Eve also says she was around storage/navigation and didn\u2019t see me, so timing around storage clearly isn\u2019t well confirmed by anyone.\n\nThe part that worries me is Alice is the reporter and is making the only hard claim that puts me at the body. If you vote me here, you\u2019re voting entirely on Alice\u2019s word against mine. Frank seeing Alice in electrical at tick 7 doesn\u2019t prove she didn\u2019t go to medbay and either find or create the report situation afterward \u2014 it only proves she was in electrical briefly.\n\nI\u2019m a goose. If you eject me, you\u2019ll see this was wrong, and you need to look hard at Alice next. I\u2019d rather skip than throw on this, but from my perspective Alice\u2019s accusation is the false one."}}
{"timestamp": 1783618008.276611, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I don\u2019t have anything new to add from my own vision \u2014 I still didn\u2019t see the body or anyone around that area from my route.\n\nBut after hearing the repeats, I\u2019m still on the same point: this is basically Alice\u2019s hard claim versus Charlie\u2019s denial, and Charlie\u2019s admitted location is at least consistent with Alice\u2019s direction call. Frank backing Alice in electrical at tick 7 makes me less likely to think Alice just invented the whole thing.\n\nCharlie\u2019s defense is fair in the sense that adjacent room isn\u2019t the same as being in medbay, but Alice isn\u2019t just saying \u201cnearby,\u201d she\u2019s saying she saw Charlie enter from storage. That\u2019s too specific to ignore.\n\nI think the best vote is Charlie here. If this somehow flips wrong, then yeah, Alice needs serious scrutiny next, but right now Charlie is the clearest lead."}}
